itatively prepared! It's not irritating, it's clean, it fits well with meat and chicken.\n\n- Impressed by the staff's kindness\nI spoke a little Korean, so it wasn't inconvenient to order, and when I said what I needed, I brought it right away. The service was also fast, and I took care of the replacement of panels or water refining.\n\n- Shop clean and pleasant\nThe store was clean inside, and the table space was wide enough to eat freely. The meat is well ventilated and smells less dirty. The bathroom was pretty clean!\n\nIn conclusion, when you have a real snack in Natrang, it is just a restaurant that fills the heart. Those who like meat and chicken will be unconditionally satisfied.\nRead more\nTranslated from Korean\nShow original\nWritten March 23, 2025",
